            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Jason_Platt_3.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>What started as a passion project to give people a place to share their home gyms has grown into a thriving community built around support, inspiration and honest advice. Members share their gym builds, equipment recommendations, training journeys and ideas, helping inspire others to create spaces they are proud of.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
