            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Jason_Platt_8.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>At Home Gym UK, community always comes first. We focus on genuine conversations between gym owners and equipment brands, sharing honest reviews, real-world feedback, useful gym hacks and helping companies understand what their customers want. We also create factory tours, giving members a behind-the-scenes look.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
