            "text": "<p>Through our Facebook, Instagram and YouTube, we showcase incredible home gyms across the UK, celebrating the creativity and passion behind them. I also share my fitness journey, from bodybuilding and Men’s Physique to rebuilding after hip reconstruction, showing that setbacks don’t have to stop progress.<br/><br/></p>",
